msgid ""
"\n"
"Our investigation of the signal from the planet's surface brought us to "
"what\n"
"seems to be an alien beacon. Based on the rock formation around the beacon, "
"it\n"
"was probably left here millions of years ago.\n"
"\n"
"https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ld2SzK\n"
"\n"
"Written by Otavio Good; 2014.\n"
"  "
